  "notes": [
    "Station codes are 4 characters (EMBR, SFIA, 12TH). Real-time, schedule and accessibility commands take uppercase codes; get-station takes the lowercase slug from list-stations.",
    "Several www.bart.gov endpoints return {\"html\": \"...\"}, so their output is an HTML fragment you need to read for times and destinations.",
    "plan-trip, get-fare and list-routes call api.bart.gov using the public key published on bart.gov's developer pages."
